11
00:00:39,581 --> 00:00:40,832
[Gus] So far it's been great.

12
00:00:42,208 --> 00:00:45,211
She's really happy. I'm really happy.
We're really happy together.

13
00:00:45,295 --> 00:00:47,046
She's killing it at work.

14
00:00:48,089 --> 00:00:49,257
And...

15
00:00:49,674 --> 00:00:51,551
