16
00:00:53,219 --> 00:00:55,430
did I only like her
'cause she is messed up?

17
00:00:58,183 --> 00:01:00,477
Do I feel the only reason
she could like me

18
00:01:00,560 --> 00:01:02,103
is because she's messed up?

19
00:01:04,189 --> 00:01:05,857
