329
00:16:29,029 --> 00:16:32,616
Hey, do you actually have time
to hear a song that I wrote?

330
00:16:32,700 --> 00:16:33,617
Yeah.

331
00:16:33,701 --> 00:16:35,536
I never play it for anyone. I wrote it.

332
00:16:35,619 --> 00:16:39,289
It's about how the people you love
the most can exploit you the most.

333
00:16:39,373 --> 00:16:41,667
That's my life story,
so I'm sure I'll love it.

334
00:16:41,750 --> 00:16:43,919
Okay, I've never played it
for anyone, so...

335
00:16:44,002 --> 00:16:45,629
-I'm ready.
-All right.

336
00:16:45,713 --> 00:16:49,633
This one... Hold on, let me find it...

337
00:16:49,717 --> 00:16:52,219
This is called "I Am Not Only Yours."

338
00:16:52,886 --> 00:16:53,887
