349
00:17:25,669 --> 00:17:28,172
♪ Who are we? ♪

350
00:17:28,255 --> 00:17:29,465
There we go. There we go.

351
00:17:29,548 --> 00:17:31,550
♪ Who are we? Who are we? ♪

352
00:17:31,633 --> 00:17:32,718
