-Justin Bieber's engineer's friend.

357
00:17:42,436 --> 00:17:46,648
Well, I mean, that's still
pretty close to Justin Bieber.

358
00:17:46,732 --> 00:17:48,275
-I mean, it's amazing.
-Oh, I know.

359
00:17:48,358 --> 00:17:50,069
I was stoked
whenever I got to work with him.

360
00:17:50,152 --> 00:17:51,653
That's crazy. I loved it.

361
00:17:52,071 --> 00:17:55,365
Thank you.
Hey, we should take a trailer pic.

362
00:17:55,449 --> 00:17:56,825
-Yeah.
-And post it. Let's see.

363
00:17:57,326 --> 00:18:00,621
Come on. Do, like, a gangster sign.

364
00:18:01,330 --> 00:18:03,874
What?

365
00:18:03,957 --> 00:18:05,793
Oh, God. Please don't post that
