366
00:18:05,876 --> 00:18:09,797
Yeah, right. I'm gonna post it
when you leave to piss you off.

367
00:18:09,880 --> 00:18:11,840
-Oh, God, no. Please don't.
-Yeah. [chuckles]

368
00:18:13,550 --> 00:18:15,886
That one's cute, though. Oh, God. No!

369
00:18:15,969 --> 00:18:18,639
-You look great in that one. Stop.
-I look so bad.

370
00:18:23,393 --> 00:18:24,603
