392
00:19:27,708 --> 00:19:30,335
You in a better mood? Take it
you had a good rehearsal with Jayke.

393
00:19:30,878 --> 00:19:34,548
Yeah, it went well. He said
he would post a picture of us.

394
00:19:34,631 --> 00:19:37,718
He did, huh? That's a big deal?

395
00:19:38,260 --> 00:19:39,428
-Kinda.
-Yeah.

396
00:19:39,511 --> 00:19:41,555
I noticed he never posts
any pictures of me.

397
00:19:41,638 --> 00:19:44,433
A little messed up, right?
Just a little hurt.

398
00:19:44,725 --> 00:19:46,143
What's that? Is that the picture?

399
00:19:49,104 --> 00:19:51,773
♪ What I have is what I earn ♪

400
00:19:51,857 --> 00:19:53,775
