-[girl on phone] Looking so good.

401
00:19:53,859 --> 00:19:56,695
Uh... Jayke. Maybe he's doing a selfie.

402
00:19:56,778 --> 00:19:59,281
-Whose voice is that?
-So sick.

403
00:19:59,364 --> 00:20:00,490
Is that Brooklyn?

404
00:20:01,366 --> 00:20:03,160
Doesn't sound like her. I don't think so.

405
00:20:03,827 --> 00:20:05,120
Who's filming?

406
00:20:05,204 --> 00:20:06,705
-Could be his mom.
-Jesus!

407
00:20:06,788 --> 00:20:07,956
Maybe it's his mom.

408
00:20:10,834 --> 00:20:13,462
♪ Who are we? Who are we? ♪

409
00:20:15,672 --> 00:20:18,091
♪ Who are we? Who are we? ♪

410
00:20:18,175 --> 00:20:19,426
♪ Who we are ♪

411
00:20:19,509 --> 00:20:21,136
[man] Hey, Arya.

412
00:20:21,220 --> 00:20:24,348
Saw the latest cuts of the show.
Strong, very strong.

413
00:20:24,431 --> 00:20:27,142
Thank you so much. The writing
is great this year, right?

414
00:20:27,226 --> 00:20:29,728
-Too modest. She won't take credit.
-Stop.

415
00:20:29,811 --> 00:20:31,230
Won't take credit.

416
00:20:35,442 --> 00:20:37,903
Oh, my God. Everybody, it's Arya Hopkins
from Witchita.

417
00:20:37,986 --> 00:20:40,239
Guys, I got to go! I'm late to set.

418
00:20:40,322 --> 00:20:42,115
Well, everybody wave to Arya.

419
00:20:43,575 --> 00:20:44,576
Sing it with me. Sing it.

420
00:20:44,660 --> 00:20:46,912
♪ Who are we? Who are we? ♪

421
00:20:46,995 --> 00:20:48,830
Yeah!

422
00:20:48,914 --> 00:20:51,667
♪ Who are we? Who are we? ♪

423
00:20:53,210 --> 00:20:54,253
