424
00:20:54,336 --> 00:20:56,713
♪ I'm not only yours ♪

425
00:20:58,340 --> 00:21:02,302
"As the caller I knew only
as Fran from Irwindale,

426
00:21:02,386 --> 00:21:06,348
stammered a thank you
between sobs of gratitude, I told her,

427
00:21:07,182 --> 00:21:10,644
'Thank yourself. You did the hard work.

428
00:21:10,727 --> 00:21:12,938
I only showed you the way.'

429
00:21:13,689 --> 00:21:18,902
Three years later,
I learned they had a beautiful baby boy.

430
00:21:19,444 --> 00:21:20,654
They named him Greg.

431
00:21:23,615 --> 00:21:25,283
I never asked why."

432
00:21:31,123 --> 00:21:32,582
