-Oh, my God.

451
00:22:25,385 --> 00:22:26,553
-Meltdown.
-Oh, my God.

452
00:22:26,636 --> 00:22:29,514
-Meltdown. It's bad, man. It is bad.
-Fuck.

453
00:22:30,182 --> 00:22:31,391
-Oh, my God.
-Yeah.

454
00:22:31,475 --> 00:22:34,394
-Holy shit!
-Yeah.

455
00:22:34,478 --> 00:22:36,813
No. I was just on her Instagram.
