456
00:22:36,897 --> 00:22:40,150
-This is her Finsta account.
-She lets you follow her Finsta?

457
00:22:40,233 --> 00:22:41,985
Yeah. You don't?

458
00:22:43,361 --> 00:22:46,698
I'm sure I do. I don't check.
I don't care about that stuff--

459
00:22:46,782 --> 00:22:48,533
I don't have time
to deal with this, okay?

460
00:22:48,617 --> 00:22:51,203
